      "difficultyBand": "foundation",
      "stem": "A stone is dropped from a balloon rising upwards with a constant velocity of 10 m/s. If the balloon is at a height of 40 m from the ground when the stone is dropped, the time taken by the stone to reach the ground is (g = 10 m/s²):",
