      "correctOptionIndex": 1,
      "correctAnswer": "4 s",
      "solution": "Initial velocity of stone u = +10 m/s (upward). Acceleration a = -g = -10 m/s². Displacement s = -40 m. Using s = ut + (1/2)at²: -40 = 10t - 5t² => 5t² - 10t - 40 = 0 => t² - 2t - 8 = 0 => (t - 4)(t + 2) = 0. Since t > 0, t = 4 s.",
